GSIP contributed-photo license

Photographs included in a public GSIP dataset release are made available under
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Only photographs with a recorded, versioned contributor grant may be released.
Each released photograph must retain the contributor's selected public
attribution name or pseudonym in the dataset metadata. Precise coordinates and
private image metadata are never part of the public release.
